Portraits in `public/images/` are NOT covered by this license. Each image keeps
its original free license (public domain, CC BY, CC BY-SA, GODL-India, …),
recorded per figure in `data/images.json`. The billboard widget displays this
credit on every rotation and embedders must preserve it.

## Data and text

The MIT license above covers the source code in this repository. The catalogue
in `data/figures.json` contains facts, summaries, taglines, and quotations:

- Facts themselves are not copyrightable.
- Summaries and taglines must be original paraphrases, not copied text. By
  contributing catalogue text, you agree to license your contribution under the
  MIT license.
- Direct quotations remain under the license of their original source. Wikipedia
  text is CC BY-SA 4.0; keep the quote's source attribution when adding it.
- Portraits are not covered by the MIT license; each image keeps the license
  recorded in `data/images.json`.
